</b>\n\n<b>135</b>(1)  a 2(e).\n \n       Part XIV of the <b>Electricity</b> Act, 2003  relates to offences\n\nand penalties and  <b>Section</b> <b>135</b>  provides <b>theft</b>", "docsize": 124084, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Jharkhand High Court", "author": "R Ranjan", "authorEncoded": "r-ranjan"}, {"tid": 160281331, "catids": null, "doctype": 1021, "publishdate": "2025-09-09", "authorid": null, "bench": null, "title": "Etendtra Kumar Ghambhir vs Madhya Pradesh Madhya Ksetra Vidhyut ... on 9 September, 2025", "numcites": 24, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "covered by  <b>Section</b> <b>135</b>  of the Act\n                          under Part IX.  <b>Section</b> <b>135</b>  of the Act reads as under:\n \n                           &quot;<b>135</b>. <b>Theft</b> of <b>Electricity</b>:- (1) Whoever ... <b>electricity</b> which is\n                          covered by  <b>Section</b> <b>135</b>  of the Act, will fall within the definition\n                          of unauthorized use of <b>electricity</b>. As per  <b>Section</b> <b>135</b>", "docsize": 82372, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Madhya Pradesh High Court"}, {"tid": 165462249, "catids": null, "doctype": 1011, "publishdate": "2025-10-13", "authorid": null, "bench": null, "title": "Page No.# 1/16 vs Assam Power Distribution Company Ltd. ... on 13 October, 2025", "numcites": 15, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "unauthorised use of <b>electricity</b> under  <b>section</b> 126  of the\n     <b>Electricity</b> Act and <b>theft</b> of <b>electricity</b> covered by  <b>section</b> <b>135</b>  are\n     different provisions and there ... abstraction.\n \n 23.    <b>Section</b> <b>135</b> , while addressing the <b>theft</b> of <b>electricity</b>, empowers\n      the disconnection of <b>electricity</b> upon detection of <b>theft</b> under\n       <b>Section</b> <b>135</b>", "docsize": 32860, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Gauhati High Court"}, {"tid": 75630952, "catids": null, "doctype": 1002, "publishdate": "2008-